000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RRDSNATR.
000300*    RRDSREAD, written against native VSAM instead of VSAMIO.
000400 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000500 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000600 FILE-CONTROL.
000700     SELECT RRDS-FILE ASSIGN TO RRDSF01
000800         ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
000900         ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
001000         FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.
001100 DATA DIVISION.
001200 FILE SECTION.
001300 FD  RRDS-FILE
001400     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
001500     RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS.
001600 01  RRDS-RECORD                 PIC X(80).
