001900 01  END-OF-FILE-SWITCH          PIC X(1)  VALUE 'N'.
002000     88  END-OF-FILE                       VALUE 'Y'.
002100 01  RECORD-COUNTER              PIC S9(8) VALUE +0.
002200 01  COUNTER-EDIT                PIC ZZ,ZZZ,ZZ9.
002300 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
